ATTRIBUTION
-----------
The underlying section-4.8 text is sourced from the Spanish drug fact
sheets (fichas técnicas / Summary of Product Characteristics, SmPC)
published by the Spanish Agency for Medicines and Medical Devices
(Agencia Española de Medicamentos y Productos Sanitarios, AEMPS)
through the CIMA portal (https://cima.aemps.es/). When redistributing
or building upon this dataset, please attribute both:

  1. Guerrero Guirado, L. M. (2026). CIMA Sección 4.8 — Reacciones
     Adversas (corpus completo para pre-entrenamiento). UNED PFG.
     https://huggingface.co/datasets/guerrerotook/CIMA-4.8-Reacciones-Adversas
  2. AEMPS — Centro de Información Online de Medicamentos (CIMA).
     https://cima.aemps.es/
